---
const href = '/collections/zybach/elliott/listen/dean-mountain/';
---
<aside class="listen-invitation" aria-label="A short oral history to listen to">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">New · Listen &amp; read · 5 minutes</p><h2><a href={href}>Ride along to Dean Mountain</a></h2><p>Hear Jerry Phillips, David Gould and their companions discuss a road, a forest and forty years of change. Follow the printed words as the recording plays.</p></div>
  <a class="listen-link" href={href}>Open the listening experience <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</aside>
<style>
  .listen-invitation { margin: 1.6rem 0; padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #bbcdbf; border-left: 5px solid #426747; border-radius: 8px; background: #f0f4e9; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { font: 700 .72rem/1.5 var(--font-sans, sans-serif); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: #456044; margin: 0 0 .35rem; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 .35rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  p { margin: .3rem 0; max-width: 70ch; }
  .listen-link { flex: 0 0 13rem; font: 700 .9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans, sans-serif); }
  @media (max-width: 45rem) { .listen-invitation { display: block; padding: 1rem; } .listen-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: .75rem; } }
</style>
